    SWHSysShower Supply Equipment Branch,  !- Name
    ,                        !- Pressure Drop Curve Name
    WaterHeater:Mixed,       !- Component 1 Object Type
    SWH Shower Water Heater,  !- Component 1 Name
    SWHSysShower Pump-Water HeaterNode,  !- Component 1 Inlet Node Name
    SWHSysShower Supply Equipment Outlet Node;  !- Component 1 Outlet Node Name

