    SWHSysShower Supply Equipment Bypass Branch,  !- Name
    ,                        !- Pressure Drop Curve Name
    Pipe:Adiabatic,          !- Component 1 Object Type
    SWHSysShower Supply Equipment Bypass Pipe,  !- Component 1 Name
    SWHSysShower Supply Equip Bypass Inlet Node,  !- Component 1 Inlet Node Name
    SWHSysShower Supply Equip Bypass Outlet Node;  !- Component 1 Outlet Node Name

